Nickname MyLinuxRelay
ContactInfo YourName <your@email.com>

ORPort 9001
DirPort 9030

ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
SocksPort 0

## Lower bandwidth for home connections
BandwidthRate 1 MB
BandwidthBurst 2 MB

## Monthly cap to avoid data overages
AccountingMax 50 GB
AccountingStart month 1 00:00

Log notice file /var/log/tor/notices.log
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor